            <title>1.0.69</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>Bug fixes</h3>
<ul>
<li>The search filter buttons no longer break words across two lines ("Un-read") when the message list is narrow. If they don't fit, they scroll sideways instead.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
