        <item>
            <title>1.0.68</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>What's new</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Share › Normal Mail.</strong> Share files, photos, web pages or text from any app to start a new message:</li>
</ul>
<p>
  - files and images arrive as attachments;
<br>  - a web page arrives as a link, with its title as the subject.
</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Drop files on the Dock icon</strong> to start a new message with them attached.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
