        <item>
            <title>1.0.67</title>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>
<strong>Beta release</strong> — please send feedback from Help › Send Feedback.
</p>
<h3>What's new</h3>
<ul>
<li><strong>Attachments.</strong> View › Attachments (⌥⌘A, or the sidebar) lists every file in your mail across all accounts, newest first. You can:</li>
</ul>
<p>
  - filter by <strong>PDFs</strong>, <strong>Images</strong> or <strong>Documents</strong>, or type a name or sender;
<br>  - double-click a file to open it;
<br>  - right-click it to <strong>Save As…</strong> or <strong>Show Conversation</strong>.
</p>]]></description>
